  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8c9477fa108fe5ac22fa147d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "周遭的人则认为这样的训练内容\n并非实战训练，无法让她在比赛中获胜，\n因此对训练员投以责难的目光。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69aedfd51211f094801e5895c3e1c6df42b03b4af4bd206315f72bd137780041",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5461ab82f8ec4664f9356b46",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是……\n目白麦昆与训练员之间的气氛\n开始变得尴尬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f44883c2bd9a1dcd388c11bb663329ad2811cd217f951b3cae17a681d7ecbffc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:231a91f44c6143064e3ed9e3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆为此感到烦恼，\n但听了目白赖恩的一席话后，\n她发现自己应该要相信训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92c2d1dae3a32064cfda850bede78a8f37c90149e79b06cfe2702737d50be362",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:54f661a4b7495fc7de7ef66b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆与训练员再次下定决心，\n决定要更加信任彼此，\n为了“天皇赏”齐心同行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef93bbb669c749ba37b9b1d6cdebf66db6f8c2c4184563186536de26e36b1b58",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c31f71ee87314da47413486",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员就该被责怪？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d92e98c1d58d4a10da2542b0bfdce4812c5f8b0f7e075ca835b3d03cbfa86b2d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:502d9aa7a3e2d330100158c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆与目白赖恩从小感情就很好。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a40e2f316cad563a8109817187c7fffd7c059319e932d1ef05fd84e2c0129556",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b9a37c52549235089f8f464",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "两人前去观战GⅠ竞赛，并再次体认到──\n赛马娘们都各自抱持着坚强的意志与信念\n前来挑战赛事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e22e63361be99c063c654a528407e2beb0fc3e6ed5395b1083e37b93370db8aa",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03de5e08d8bcaf86da0e07aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她们即将迎接经典赛，\n因而比以往更加强烈地在意起彼此。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1415821ca194e7eeb99ebf74685871be09c8776a76e78c2efc208d5fa8fd7e0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32c9643145ed7a765c18f88c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一如往昔",
      "source_fingerprint": "a75ea950e7bcd73d44a857dedbb41264a2b7bb64342876c8a6ee95c4caf03333",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28990378c408ea9a2d148c8f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆正为了“菊花赏”加紧训练──",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f6137365a4d7f5e13d7cf51d8936df8992ce737173fb835f2ee0f1151a1e2dd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d7aab930de7d9fe7e833214",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而她也亲眼见识到了同样以拿下“菊花赏”\n为目标的目白赖恩的那股气势。",
      "source_fingerprint": "43c76f3b069ed6a80b55e06c7142315d941d3c3c08c33c4492e414ee943a52e6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec137fd4d6580d90de909844",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆燃起了斗志，不愿输掉这场赛事。\n目白赖恩则为了回应她的意念，\n向她下了战帖，希望来场“认真对决”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91c9943e4bf8f910d13ae3ef1d6c5399fc6f9b960f23d6f4559286ebbe5d1a0a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dd1853fa948767ea79c8a7d8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆接受了她的挑战。\n……于是目白家的赛马娘们立下了约定，\n要在“菊花赏”上认真对决。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91e36ec764b8f433c9a1a57fd56ec46534246672478e6797f2f06cc49b2168eb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58393304c5ca3645567b59c0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与赖恩之战即将开始",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7c4c92977bc3bb3c291d91c0cb2df2a9551b6d0cefd49765364652eb6b639c4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b153897c5dda198fa9ab49b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆的目标──\n大型赛事“天皇赏（春）”眼看就要到来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b94b8977b786a2bbf16e0da968190c8b926c30b272f69a74d84c0268cd6bcf6f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:376e290f4fe409e61390857c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "以目白家的栋梁“奶奶”为首，\n为了让尊敬的目白家成员们\n看到自己赢得“天皇赏”的模样──",
      "source_fingerprint": "f809e2baa15266bf88c999cfa1513e0cf6f08665e590d41742862a226c5c7a39",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bc26ee0e4b7b6a4be9de2e73",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆在心里强烈地想着，\n自己绝对要拿下这场赛事。",
      "source_fingerprint": "88267b6cb88be6c61f479d5e5f6b79226dd64ad940fc266d695ed36efdfc2d9c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3ec8cbea653c9d744c059ba8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而另一方面……目白赖恩也下定决心，\n决定参加“天皇赏（春）”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6fe476020f302494710dda4906fbcfa394a08637a08dbffb6956072736ec6b0d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12475b84d24d673504d54ff6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "灌注于“天皇赏”的意志",
      "source_fingerprint": "2940363d4b8248967961ef52de18c7d70d6e9b7edd023f5a97123ca609808557",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:885154ea53929f94b8533c12",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "天皇赏结束后的某天，目白麦昆收到了\n来自“奶奶”本人的殷切期待，\n希望她能替“目白家”指引一条新的道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ca113f17b11d422c47fd230ac118bce80237b5263ff005c3e72600bd3acce87f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ab2ee7398dcce8644e3cfc8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对这突然的状况，目白麦昆还来不及\n整理自己的心情。目白赖恩见状，\n便对她表达激励──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad8787491ef3e4aa302061488e067aff45d9eb5a4399e46bbe637d2f67304f17",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6650dfafe1243b5da0739ba6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她更表示，自己也跟目白麦昆一样\n想要“变强”……\n并且再次提出了对决的要求。",
      "source_fingerprint": "187410ec2ef4802b9d7f415da5741c742d9b867e7cd59760765c399f20d08abf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1c582f317e0a65924680271",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆见识到她的决心后，\n为了展现自己“已准备好一肩扛起目白家”，\n便答应了在“宝冢纪念”上对决的提议。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bef74d08cbd6297555f96bf45448b7c2690cd51ce3639fb25e75dfe96643193",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e9a08c33b39000e4f76d060",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "继承目白家之人",
      "source_fingerprint": "9625ee977254554a12ff3ce5519ed64fe492bbaf52c0446e63fdb4b440ca316e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9d4622dabb63694f92ff0ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“夏季集训”开始了，\n在大自然中修行让目白麦昆雀跃不已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "000749593d02d5203ae7bcd26c3c4ba0d64d7ab3ea0c346789939f4cc7278284",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d335f5ceddc7b7f522a4955",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "面对“菊花赏”以及\n这场比赛的前哨战“神户报杯”──",
      "source_fingerprint": "68bda57fdc3c668c6650dfb32c9b4595e5f3343bdef8bdb1d0d4ea03d26be134",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:faf0adec8b75fefefbaabd2d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她内心一阵激昂，充满了干劲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc9c54a56f3b568113bead704d850b58923b4dcfd8740893123c6c3ffe388dce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ed50f21074962b81b484f58",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训（第二年）开始！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e193ad94ba56712a8e92ed87a15587d1a6af48670f61e354efcb818a0837f0c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
