      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆为了达成春秋连霸的创举，\n更加绷紧了神经。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fbbdd7eddb67f1900d8a24605ec378892fe2cbb37a0fa30c8b97c1687fea07e5",
