      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6e4eb85ae3450c91126ca89",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在热闹滚滚的赛场上，\n目白麦昆与目白赖恩的“目白家”对决\n成了众人的目光焦点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd8fd1d90e70d5a1b659c21ab820ec1c84f117e938442a2ecbe0aa5d75b641ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013410.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f70182c37d546a78b4037e24",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这样的盛况下，\n目白麦昆以抬头挺胸的态度前往迎战……\n她与目白赖恩的认真对决即将展开。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ffb46a29eda302744fdd6af89a5105008ba1778f53d908575843944d33539efd",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013410.json",
      "json_path": [
