      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尽管目白麦昆感到紧张，\n她依然怀抱着对“目白家”的情感，\n誓言要拿出全力参赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "04dbfe9d3e3c8a0e6e5f8982de4fcb6494d5bcc83259950d38e14aacad77722b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ebcf7acb1227172bb78416c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "就在进入赛道前，\n目白麦昆碰上了目白赖恩。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0686e79355a8e2523690cd723b84cab2bf18df87e8c3b011eb4217c94cc027a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013411.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c165c907af763284e5e68194",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "身为“目白家”的赛马娘，\n两人替彼此加油打气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "eba8fd35ce6a4d92a408b9598fab566ebb1c808104942669ec91b2c43d148e3f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
