    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:151a8f158f5f5b3c3d2c62cc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“天皇赏（秋）”的比赛即将开始，\n目白麦昆平静地回顾起\n至今为止的这些日子。",
      "source_fingerprint": "814a3a3d890d22588938ad508e469e9334f9fb32337b4a72790dc50515e67138",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d0acfabf3b72592edff4d673",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与训练员不断努力的每一天，\n与对手们互相较量的回忆，以及──",
      "source_fingerprint": "20b9a6ece6b6816fe73d2c2589b43b9dbf82d3311450e7b363893e65af6ebf2d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60e83fc3a317e3696a1037a0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与目白赖恩在“宝冢纪念”上的那场对决，\n那让她对目白家赛马娘的身份\n更加有所体认了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c94c46fce9187bb7a280444cdb3398e5a3cb16dbabce0e65cd63c94750dcb246",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013413.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c023cf4e41a81e956d809b5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白麦昆怀着激昂决心……\n表示自己要竭尽全力跑完“天皇赏（秋）”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc0f7283cb29b10c8daaa4b3d5df943b707328a64e6034eb85b44589dbcbabca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1013/storytimeline_501013413.json",
      "json_path": [
